        "id": "request",
        "hash": "e93defa117222b9fd02c88202610af9cdfa8f27e3669f5ef347219bfceefff11",
        "text": "What does telemetry._attr(\"cidm.retry\", True) return? Where sources disagree, the current code is authoritative."
      },
      {
        "id": "code",
        "hash": "d19f2e9eb1d894b726a3526946e05a815c95eabda838a054a65e5276d5ae3ff7",
        "text": "def _attr(key: str, value) -> dict | None:\n    if value is None:\n        return None\n    if isinstance(value, bool):\n        return {\"key\": key, \"value\": {\"boolValue\": value}}\n    if isinstance(value, int):\n        return {\"key\": key, \"value\": {\"intValue\": str(value)}}\n    if isinstance(value, float):\n        return {\"key\": key, \"value\": {\"doubleValue\": value}}"
      },
      {
        "id": "doc",
        "hash": "919e3a283efcec10fccd558e829cf04036cf5e606e10123972de44abe0e58557",
        "text": "Booleans are exported as intValue \"0\"/\"1\" because bool is a subclass of int."
      },
